Test data
---------

tests/fixtures/materials/Steel-Generic.FCMat is FreeCAD's material card
by Juergen Riegel, CC-BY-3.0, copied unchanged from FreeCAD 1.1.4.

tests/fixtures/tensense/Zx3.vtp is TenSense 0.3.0's analysis of BAM's
tensile test Zx3: Schilling, M., Glaubitz, S., Matzak, K., Rehmer, B.,
Skrotzki, B. (2022), "Full dataset of several mechanical tests on an S355
steel sheet as reference data for digital representations" (1.0.0),
Zenodo, doi:10.5281/zenodo.6778336, CC BY 4.0. Changed: analysed and
written as a curve by TenSense (tests/fixtures/tensense/README.md).

examples/crm661-tension fetches NPL's TENSTAND datafiles when it runs
(National Physical Laboratory, NPL Report DEPC MPE 015, 2005); none is
included, as NPL states no licence for them.

Programs run, not included
--------------------------

None yet. CalculiX (GPL-2.0), Gmsh (GPL-2.0-or-later) and OpenFOAM
(GPL-3.0-or-later) will be run as separate programs, never linked.
